{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/e3a7683e0fef8728c478060c452b1d5b.webp?t=1774207581\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/e3a7683e0fef8728c478060c452b1d5b.poster.avif?t=1774207581\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2708\ufe0f Plane Balance: Smugglers or Saints?</strong><br><i>Pack it. Risk it. Send it.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a freelance pilot with one dream: earn enough money to buy your cozy lakeside house with a private airfield and retire happily with your otter companion. But how you get there \u2014 or whether you get there \u2014is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you play it safe, delivering legal cargo for steady pay? Or do you risk it all smuggling shady packages for big profits and bigger consequences?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tetris-Style Packing</strong> \u2013 Every job gives you oddly-shaped packages to fit into your plane\u2019s cargo grid. Keep things balanced or lose money due to rough flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/f719f7b5fb6a4581b2dfb612b5aaef3a.poster.avif?t=1774207581\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/f719f7b5fb6a4581b2dfb612b5aaef3a.webm?t=1774207581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/f719f7b5fb6a4581b2dfb612b5aaef3a.mp4?t=1774207581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward</strong> \u2013 Legal deliveries are safe but low-paying. Illegal cargo can make you rich \u2014 if you don\u2019t get caught.\u00a0Your choices shape your career and reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/755b781f67dd24534f6eb375eff5cead.poster.avif?t=1774207581\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/755b781f67dd24534f6eb375eff5cead.webm?t=1774207581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/755b781f67dd24534f6eb375eff5cead.mp4?t=1774207581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Inspections</strong> \u2013 Customs officers check <strong>random cargo slots</strong> for contraband. If they find something shady, kiss your payout goodbye.\u00a0Or try to win it back\u2026in a little backroom game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/ff8706781e297ebea9dd7d3103fe3b78.poster.avif?t=1774207581\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/ff8706781e297ebea9dd7d3103fe3b78.webm?t=1774207581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/ff8706781e297ebea9dd7d3103fe3b78.mp4?t=1774207581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wanted Status</strong> \u2013 Build a bad reputation and you\u2019ll attract <strong>special police raids</strong>. You\u2019ll get warnings, but can you notice them in time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/1baceaa17a5b2cda1dc1f044be00017a.poster.avif?t=1774207581\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/1baceaa17a5b2cda1dc1f044be00017a.webm?t=1774207581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/1baceaa17a5b2cda1dc1f044be00017a.mp4?t=1774207581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain level points, boost your cargo plane, unlock new skills and airports!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/253c6ae5c1d869f68374bc74ed8d18b3.poster.avif?t=1774207581\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/253c6ae5c1d869f68374bc74ed8d18b3.webm?t=1774207581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/253c6ae5c1d869f68374bc74ed8d18b3.mp4?t=1774207581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/d49a3171c39a7381ec899c79164b5ecd.poster.avif?t=1774207581\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/d49a3171c39a7381ec899c79164b5ecd.webm?t=1774207581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/d49a3171c39a7381ec899c79164b5ecd.mp4?t=1774207581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udda6 Your Otter Companion <i>(pet character in progress)</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always by your side, cheering (or squeaking nervously) as you stack your plane full.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reacts to risky decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax with your otter at home and share quiet moments away from the hustle. <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962410/extras/eaf5ff8daf1cd71ab36b92d285d03e70.avif?t=1774207581\" width=222 height=222 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfe1 The Big Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn enough money to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new places to unlock new planes and customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new planes with larger cargo grids and hidden compartments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally purchase your <strong>dream lake house </strong>\u2014 your happily-ever-after.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Style &amp; Vibe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy, colorful, casual puzzle-sim with a cheeky sense of humor. Ch